  "prefLabel": "Plc 1404.06 Initial Licenses: Issuance and Duration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1404.06 Initial Licenses: Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall issue initial licenses to practice recreational therapy in accordance with Plc 304.11.\n\n(b) Initial licenses shall be valid as provided in Plc 304.12.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442 (formerly Plc 1404.08), eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
